{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "source_image_sha256": "588b4288e4c737dc489d2b9bc0652cca85e3d668b1784942ef4b4bda916f1005",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "chapter": 42,
      "source": "ADV/DAT/CHAPTER042.YBC",
      "sha256": "63de0f2ade9937055ce71a553efc86142715093c29522b79f25d27dcef711375",
      "text_count": 118,
      "pages": [
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 222,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            0,
            1,
            2
          ],
          "text": "各位是因為曾經在篳路藍縷之中，胼手胝足地努力，\n所以才會身列四大學級之一，成就要以努力來獲得，\n這是不變的道理。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 250,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            3,
            4
          ],
          "text": "然而，各位離開了「白皙的城砦」安蒂米昂，\n像是小孩子辦家家酒一樣地又哭又笑，究竟又是為了什麼？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 272,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            5
          ],
          "text": "看哪，那些幼小孩子們在恐懼中的可憐身影。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 294,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            6
          ],
          "text": "看哪，那呼喚混沌、繼承邪惡血脈傢伙們的惡行惡狀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 326,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            7,
            8
          ],
          "text": "如果你們還懂得那一點點的廉恥，就在那必然會來臨的時機下，\n在我們葛斯貝布洛的膝下臣服，宣誓效忠吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 354,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            9,
            10
          ],
          "text": "若有反抗，奉行鋼鐵般正義的我們，討伐你們的戰爭，\n也只會像是單方面的虐殺而已。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 382,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            11,
            12
          ],
          "text": "　　\n　　　　　　　　　葛斯貝布洛總帥代理代希里鄔司‧謬斯"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 458,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            13,
            14
          ],
          "text": "葛斯貝布洛會以這樣的形式開始動作，\n還真是令人想像不到，是吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 486,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            15,
            16
          ],
          "text": "不但一點禮貌也沒有，\n甚至連個客套話都不說呢……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 536,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            17
          ],
          "text": "……帕彌菈。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 570,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            18
          ],
          "text": "唉呀，法娜。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 596,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            19
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 622,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            20
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 656,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            21
          ],
          "text": "我之前……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 678,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            22
          ],
          "text": "都沒有周詳地考慮過呢。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 706,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            23,
            24
          ],
          "text": "既然帕蘭達因曾以執掌黑闇為由，\n討伐聖瑟維艾斯……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 728,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            25
          ],
          "text": "那麼，藏匿聖瑟維艾斯的生還者的行為也……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 762,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            26
          ],
          "text": "老師已經決定了要洗清聖瑟維艾斯的污名。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 796,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            27
          ],
          "text": "……可是。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 818,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            28
          ],
          "text": "我……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 840,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            29
          ],
          "text": "如果不是因為我在這裡的話，"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 862,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            30
          ],
          "text": "不動的橋墩也不會……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 908,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            31,
            32,
            33
          ],
          "text": "法娜，就算真的是像妳說的這樣，\n到了現在這種地步，\n我們也絕對不會交出任何人的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 936,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            34,
            35
          ],
          "text": "不，從一開始接納妳進入純潔之盾的時候，\n老師就已經有這樣的覺悟了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 962,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            36
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 1002,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            37,
            38
          ],
          "text": "而在那之後不論會有怎麼樣的結果，\n他都會用笑容去面對，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 1024,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            39
          ],
          "text": "他就是這樣的一個人。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 1050,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            40
          ],
          "text": "法娜。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 1072,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            41
          ],
          "text": "妳所選擇的老師，就是這樣的一個人。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 1098,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            42
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 1132,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            43
          ],
          "text": "所以啊，就打起精神來吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 1160,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            44,
            45
          ],
          "text": "對於這麼無聊的話語，\n妳又有什麼好迷惑的呢？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 1194,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            46
          ],
          "text": "……抱歉，帕彌菈。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 1228,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            47
          ],
          "text": "別在意。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 1262,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            48
          ],
          "text": "……夏朧呢？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 1296,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            49
          ],
          "text": "她現在應該跟老師在一起吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 1324,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            50,
            51
          ],
          "text": "這世界上還是有很多不要問清楚會比較好的事\n情呢。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 1364,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            52,
            53
          ],
          "text": "…………\n那麼，我也不會再迷惑了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 1386,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            54
          ],
          "text": "從今以後，只要想著為純潔之盾效力就好了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 1420,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            55
          ],
          "text": "嗯嗯。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 1454,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            56
          ],
          "text": "……那，我想向老師建議收復安蒂米昂。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 1488,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            57
          ],
          "text": "好啊。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 1510,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            58
          ],
          "text": "我想，老師一定也在等我們這樣做呢。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 1544,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            59
          ],
          "text": "……那就這麼決定啦。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 1634,
          "speaker_id": 8,
          "speaker": "奎絲忒",
          "text_indices": [
            60
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 1690,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            61,
            62
          ],
          "text": "在愛爾梅納斯危急存亡的關頭，\n竟然這樣……真是過分……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 1712,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            63
          ],
          "text": "明明是劍聖輩出的名門……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 1746,
          "speaker_id": 8,
          "speaker": "奎絲忒",
          "text_indices": [
            64
          ],
          "text": "可是……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 1774,
          "speaker_id": 8,
          "speaker": "奎絲忒",
          "text_indices": [
            65,
            66
          ],
          "text": "我稍微可以瞭解，\n他們其實想和我們在一起的心情。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 1808,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            67
          ],
          "text": "……奎絲忒。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 1836,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            68,
            69
          ],
          "text": "那封信，嗯嗯，\n雖然我不知道那可不可以叫做一封信啦。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 1858,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            70
          ],
          "text": "像那樣是不行的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 1892,
          "speaker_id": 8,
          "speaker": "奎絲忒",
          "text_indices": [
            71
          ],
          "text": "但是，我不覺得那是他們的本意……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 1926,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            72
          ],
          "text": "……咦？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 1960,
          "speaker_id": 8,
          "speaker": "奎絲忒",
          "text_indices": [
            73
          ],
          "text": "就好像，嗯。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 1982,
          "speaker_id": 8,
          "speaker": "奎絲忒",
          "text_indices": [
            74
          ],
          "text": "對第一次見面的小狗稍微地欺負一下而已。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 2004,
          "speaker_id": 8,
          "speaker": "奎絲忒",
          "text_indices": [
            75
          ],
          "text": "對吧？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 2038,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            76
          ],
          "text": "不會吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 2072,
          "speaker_id": 8,
          "speaker": "奎絲忒",
          "text_indices": [
            77
          ],
          "text": "嗯……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 2094,
          "speaker_id": 8,
          "speaker": "奎絲忒",
          "text_indices": [
            78
          ],
          "text": "可是……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 2116,
          "speaker_id": 8,
          "speaker": "奎絲忒",
          "text_indices": [
            79
          ],
          "text": "因為那個語氣給我一種…非常…笨拙的感覺。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 2214,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            80
          ],
          "text": "老師。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 2252,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            81
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 2286,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            82
          ],
          "text": "現在要回去嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 2308,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            83
          ],
          "text": "差不多也該回到安蒂米昂了吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 2358,
          "speaker_id": 9,
          "speaker": "伊里安",
          "text_indices": [
            84
          ],
          "text": "啊……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 2420,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            85
          ],
          "text": "哇嗚！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 2482,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            86
          ],
          "text": "呵……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 2544,
          "speaker_id": 8,
          "speaker": "奎絲忒",
          "text_indices": [
            87
          ],
          "text": "啊啊？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 2598,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            88
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 2620,
          "speaker_id": 8,
          "speaker": "奎絲忒",
          "text_indices": [
            89
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 2678,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            90
          ],
          "text": "安蒂米昂……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 2704,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            91
          ],
          "text": "你們幾個的想法如何？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 2726,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            92
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 2776,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            93
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 2798,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            94
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 2856,
          "speaker_id": 9,
          "speaker": "伊里安",
          "text_indices": [
            95
          ],
          "text": "當然，不可能不想回去啦……！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 2918,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            96
          ],
          "text": "我也想要回去。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 2940,
          "speaker_id": 9,
          "speaker": "伊里安",
          "text_indices": [
            97
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 2962,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            98
          ],
          "text": "艾爾雪？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 2984,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            99
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 3042,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            100
          ],
          "text": "我沒有異議。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 3068,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            101
          ],
          "text": "夏朧？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 3130,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            102
          ],
          "text": "如果那就是純潔之盾應該要走的道路的話。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 3152,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            103
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 3210,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            104
          ],
          "text": "試試看吧，老師。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 3232,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            105
          ],
          "text": "一起回到安蒂米昂吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 3300,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            106,
            107
          ],
          "text": "如果成功的話，那些人對我們的評價，應該也\n會稍微有所改變吧。我是這樣想的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 3328,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            108,
            109
          ],
          "text": "我想讓他們看看，\n這點程度的事情我們是辦得到的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 3350,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            110
          ],
          "text": "我們才不會每天在哭泣裡入睡呢……！！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 3372,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            111
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 3394,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            112
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 3428,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            113
          ],
          "text": "請求您……！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 3466,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            114,
            115,
            116
          ],
          "text": "我瞭解了。\n如果大家的想法都一致的話……\n那麼我們就出發吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 42,
          "source_offset": 3500,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            117
          ],
          "text": "是！！"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [
        {
          "offset": 3532,
          "opcode": 15,
          "string_index": 1,
          "target": "data/adv/dat/Chapter302.ybc"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 302,
      "source": "ADV/DAT/CHAPTER302.YBC",
      "sha256": "212e82acadf9991ee7447d61d4bdbc66fbd8b35352639ae8788fe8e79f5afc6a",
      "text_count": 118,
      "pages": [
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 104,
          "speaker_id": 118,
          "speaker": "芭特菈",
          "text_indices": [
            0,
            1
          ],
          "text": "你也在這裡啊，真是剛好，\n我正有話想跟你說呢。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 142,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            2
          ],
          "text": "天秤之長……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 180,
          "speaker_id": 118,
          "speaker": "芭特菈",
          "text_indices": [
            3,
            4,
            5
          ],
          "text": "雖然我才剛來純潔之盾不久……\n但是我已經開始瞭解純潔之盾的人們\n心中在想的是些什麼了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 206,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            6
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 238,
          "speaker_id": 118,
          "speaker": "芭特菈",
          "text_indices": [
            7,
            8
          ],
          "text": "我聽說孩子們已經下定決心了，\n純潔之盾也該回到那自己應該駐守的地方了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 264,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            9
          ],
          "text": "……回到安蒂米昂。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 302,
          "speaker_id": 118,
          "speaker": "芭特菈",
          "text_indices": [
            10,
            11,
            12
          ],
          "text": "是的。\n如果錯失了這次機會。\n以後想要再回去，恐怕就很難了吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 324,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            13
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 364,
          "speaker_id": 118,
          "speaker": "芭特菈",
          "text_indices": [
            14,
            15,
            16,
            17
          ],
          "text": "雖然「匍伏蔓延而來之物」是從混沌裡產生出\n來的東西，\n但是我最近卻開始感覺，\n它們的行動也有一定的規則。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 400,
          "speaker_id": 118,
          "speaker": "芭特菈",
          "text_indices": [
            18,
            19,
            20,
            21
          ],
          "text": "雖然不知道它們的目的究竟是什麼……\n不過，一旦有什麼緊急狀況的話，\n如果我們不是在安蒂米昂，\n能夠做出的應變就真的差很多了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 438,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            22,
            23,
            24
          ],
          "text": "的確。\n那裡所蘊藏的力量，\n是這個艾爾貝洛瓦所不能相比的呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 464,
          "speaker_id": 118,
          "speaker": "芭特菈",
          "text_indices": [
            25
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 496,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            26,
            27
          ],
          "text": "我會好好考慮的。\n……考慮離開這裡。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 522,
          "speaker_id": 118,
          "speaker": "芭特菈",
          "text_indices": [
            28
          ],
          "text": "你有信心嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 560,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            29,
            30,
            31
          ],
          "text": "……如果我說我完全不會不安的話，\n那肯定是在說謊。\n畢竟愛爾梅納斯裡的混沌是這麼地深呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 604,
          "speaker_id": 118,
          "speaker": "芭特菈",
          "text_indices": [
            32,
            33,
            34,
            35
          ],
          "text": "……我這個老太婆呀，\n可不是無所事事地一直被關著呢。\n我可是有著掌管混沌與秩序的天秤之長名號…\n我這個老太婆有一個計畫想告訴你。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 630,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            36
          ],
          "text": "……請您說給我聽聽看吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 750,
          "speaker_id": 118,
          "speaker": "芭特菈",
          "text_indices": [
            37,
            38,
            39,
            40
          ],
          "text": "那冠上了四大學級居城之名的尊貴建築，\n被無數的城牆與護城河所包圍的白皙城砦呀，\n雖然它現在落入了混沌的手中，不過，\n就讓我們把它的力量交還給原本的主人吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 792,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            41
          ],
          "text": "那你打算怎麼做呢？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 814,
          "speaker_id": 118,
          "speaker": "芭特菈",
          "text_indices": [
            42
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 848,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            43
          ],
          "text": "就以其人之道還治其人之身吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 874,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            44
          ],
          "text": "……果然還是要從地下著手是吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 896,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            45
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 946,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            46
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 968,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            47
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 1014,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            48,
            49,
            50,
            51,
            52
          ],
          "text": "但是以我們這種半調子的實力，\n是沒辦法攻陷安蒂米昂的。\n如果從地上直接進攻的話，\n在到達城砦的中心之前，\n恐怕就已經不知道會被打敗多少次了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 1068,
          "speaker_id": 110,
          "speaker": "帕佩修",
          "text_indices": [
            53
          ],
          "text": "那裡就是特地設計成不輕易讓敵人靠近的呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 1094,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            54
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 1126,
          "speaker_id": 110,
          "speaker": "帕佩修",
          "text_indices": [
            55,
            56
          ],
          "text": "這件事情，相信我的朋友你是最清楚的了。\n如果想要攻陷那裡的話，正面進攻是不行的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 1152,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            57
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 1174,
          "speaker_id": 110,
          "speaker": "帕佩修",
          "text_indices": [
            58
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 1220,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            59,
            60,
            61,
            62,
            63
          ],
          "text": "就像「匍伏蔓延而來之物」所做的一樣……\n我們從地下潛入城堡的核心，\n直接攻擊主城就好了。\n……不過，就算這樣，\n也不是真的有很大的勝算就是了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 1252,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            64,
            65
          ],
          "text": "如果你認為這是最完美的方法的話，\n我會支持你的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 1278,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            66
          ],
          "text": "老師……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 1300,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            67
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 1350,
          "speaker_id": 118,
          "speaker": "芭特菈",
          "text_indices": [
            68
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 1372,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            69
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 1446,
          "speaker_id": 110,
          "speaker": "帕佩修",
          "text_indices": [
            70,
            71,
            72,
            73,
            74
          ],
          "text": "但是……我的朋友。\n在通往安蒂米昂的地下通道裡，\n有那個傢伙在把守呀。\n全身蓋滿了赤銅鎧甲的異形混沌－－\n赤壁的鄔爾戈呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 1472,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            75
          ],
          "text": "……天秤之長。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 1494,
          "speaker_id": 110,
          "speaker": "帕佩修",
          "text_indices": [
            76
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 1540,
          "speaker_id": 118,
          "speaker": "芭特菈",
          "text_indices": [
            77,
            78,
            79,
            80,
            81
          ],
          "text": "就如同鎖匙之長所說的一樣……\n只要那傢伙還領導著「匍伏蔓延而來之物」的\n話，\n地底的通道就非常危險。\n甚至可能會跟白皙城砦一樣地難以攻破。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 1562,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            82
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 1584,
          "speaker_id": 110,
          "speaker": "帕佩修",
          "text_indices": [
            83
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 1628,
          "speaker_id": 118,
          "speaker": "芭特菈",
          "text_indices": [
            84,
            85,
            86,
            87
          ],
          "text": "但是……\n有個地方跟赤壁鄔爾戈的因緣很深厚。\n如果去攻擊那個地方的話，\n鄔爾戈一定會現身阻止的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 1682,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            88
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 1720,
          "speaker_id": 118,
          "speaker": "芭特菈",
          "text_indices": [
            89,
            90,
            91
          ],
          "text": "……那個地方就是攸利亞。\n只要能夠打倒被我們引誘出來的赤壁鄔爾戈的\n話……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 1750,
          "speaker_id": 118,
          "speaker": "芭特菈",
          "text_indices": [
            92,
            93,
            94
          ],
          "text": "就可以順利地破壞「匍伏蔓延而來之物」才剛\n剛建立起來的領導組織了。\n就算那只能讓它們混亂一小段時間也好。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 1804,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            95
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 1854,
          "speaker_id": 118,
          "speaker": "芭特菈",
          "text_indices": [
            96,
            97,
            98,
            99,
            100
          ],
          "text": "……在通往安蒂米昂的路上，\n有不少以前不曾碰過的強敵。\n但是只要他們沒有辦法組織性地行動的話……\n對純潔之盾來說，\n就是創造了不少的生機呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 1880,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            101
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 1934,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            102
          ],
          "text": "那麼，要在什麼時候出發攻擊攸利亞呢？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 1956,
          "speaker_id": 118,
          "speaker": "芭特菈",
          "text_indices": [
            103
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 1996,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            104,
            105,
            106,
            107
          ],
          "text": "在三個星期以後，\n天上的三個月亮會聚集在一起，\n在那充滿祝福的七月第三週裡。\n我們就朝著安蒂米昂出發，離開艾爾貝洛瓦。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 2022,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            108
          ],
          "text": "唔嗯。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 2044,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            109
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 2078,
          "speaker_id": 118,
          "speaker": "芭特菈",
          "text_indices": [
            110,
            111,
            112
          ],
          "text": "我們年輕的純潔之盾之長呀，\n但願你能為那連續而來的艱苦戰役做好萬全的\n準備。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 2100,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            113
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 2122,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            114
          ],
          "text": "……是的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 302,
          "source_offset": 2154,
          "speaker_id": 118,
          "speaker": "芭特菈",
          "text_indices": [
            115,
            116
          ],
          "text": "那麼，直到那即將來臨的時刻之前，\n好好努力吧。"
        },
